# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, K03 NS-ROLES-CALL (docs :668): Model exists, so `Model: b o` at the root is Model's call,
# refused by its arity.  EXACT DEBT (steps/defects.md#typed-binding-purpose-debt): an Other refused by a Model-typed b's uses.
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

int: out 0
o: merge: Other
Model: b o
b\value: 9U
out: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: out; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
